[TFMCategory("@SYS4440", "None: User is allowed to register a higher/lower value. Warn: Warn the user if a value higher or lower than the suggested value is entered. The user must accept the prompt. Block: The user is not allowed to register a value over or under the expected. An error message is displayed")]
